# --- report material -----------------------------------------------------------
# The written report (REPORT.md, figures, build/verification scripts) and the small
# evidence CSVs that back it now live outside this repository, in the sibling folder
# deepvecfont-v2-report/, and are submitted separately. Ignored here so a regenerated
# copy of any of them is never re-tracked by accident.
report/
oracle_chn.csv
oracle_eng_subset34.csv
selection_audit.csv
val_metric_audit.csv

*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# Papers. Linked from README.md rather than vendored: they are large, they are not
# ours to redistribute, and arXiv is a more durable address than a git blob.
DeepVecFontV2.pdf
DeepVecFont v1.pdf
FinalProjectPart2.pdf

# Staging area for removal. This sandbox cannot delete files on the Mac, so anything
# retired gets moved here and Ben removes the folder himself. Never tracked.
_to_delete/
